      369.61,
      540.0,
      428.68
    ],
    "text": "IN pursuance of the power vested in me by Section 69 of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), I, RanasinghegeSemasinghe, Director General of Customs, do, with the approval of the Minister of Finance granted by virtue of thepowers vested in him by that Section, by this notice published in accordance with his direction approve and appointwarehouses and places of security specified under Column 03 of the Schedule annexed hereto, as an UnaccompaniedPassenger Baggage Bonded Warehouse in which such goods may be warehoused, kept and secured without payment of duty.",
